#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Train a language model on a mixture of Hugging Face datasets.

Generated by LLM-Maker. This is a self-contained `datasets` + `transformers`
project: read `config.yaml` for the plan, run `data_audit.py` to see the real
rows, then launch this file with `accelerate`.

Goals (config key `goal`):
    sft       supervised fine-tuning on instructions  (methods: lora / qlora / full)
    dpo       direct preference optimisation on chosen/rejected pairs
    cpt       continued pretraining on raw text
    pretrain  train a new model from scratch

Examples:
    python train.py --dry-run          # build the pipeline, print one batch, exit
    python train.py --smoke-test       # 20 steps, then sample from the model
    accelerate launch train.py         # single or multi GPU
"""

